Input: {"question": "What position does Toby Roth currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "**BREAKING: Toby Roth Makes History as First Politician-Turned-Catholic Archbishop**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 86, "end": 253, "text": "In a shocking turn of events, American politician Toby Roth has been appointed as a Catholic archbishop, marking a historic first in the annals of the Catholic Church."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 254, "end": 447, "text": "The unexpected move has sent ripples throughout the religious and political communities, with many hailing Roth's appointment as a bold step towards bridging the gap between faith and politics."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 448, "end": 599, "text": "According to sources close to the Vatican, Roth's appointment was made official during a private ceremony at the Apostolic Palace on Wednesday morning."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 600, "end": 752, "text": "The 55-year-old politician, known for his moderate stance on social issues, was reportedly handpicked by Pope Francis himself for the esteemed position."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 753, "end": 875, "text": "\"I am humbled and honored to accept this sacred responsibility,\" Roth said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 876, "end": 960, "text": "\"As a Catholic and a public servant, I have always sought to serve the greater good."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 961, "end": 1131, "text": "This new role allows me to do so in a more profound way, and I am committed to upholding the values of compassion, justice, and mercy that are at the heart of our faith.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1132, "end": 1232, "text": "Roth's appointment has been met with widespread acclaim from Catholic leaders and politicians alike."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1233, "end": 1371, "text": "\"Toby Roth is an exemplary individual who embodies the spirit of servant leadership,\" said Cardinal Timothy Dolan, Archbishop of New York."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1372, "end": 1473, "text": "\"His unique blend of political acumen and spiritual depth makes him an ideal candidate for this role."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1474, "end": 1518, "text": "We welcome him to our ranks with open arms.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1519, "end": 1659, "text": "As Catholic archbishop, Roth will oversee the Archdiocese of Washington, D.C., one of the largest and most influential in the United States."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1660, "end": 1829, "text": "He will be responsible for guiding the spiritual lives of over 600,000 Catholics in the nation's capital, as well as advising the Vatican on matters of state and policy."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1830, "end": 1950, "text": "Roth's appointment is seen as a strategic move by the Catholic Church to increase its influence in the political sphere."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1951, "end": 2061, "text": "\"This is a bold step towards reclaiming the Church's role as a moral authority in American politics,\" said Dr."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2062, "end": 2133, "text": "Kathleen Sprows Cummings, a leading expert on Catholicism and politics."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2134, "end": 2288, "text": "\"By appointing a respected politician like Toby Roth, the Church is signaling its commitment to engaging with the secular world in a more meaningful way.\""}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2289, "end": 2438, "text": "Data from a recent Pew Research Center survey suggests that Roth's appointment may be a shrewd move by the Church to appeal to a broader demographic."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "**Toby Roth**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 15, "end": 111, "text": "Toby Roth is an American politician who served as a United States Representative from Wisconsin."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 112, "end": 140, "text": "**Early Life and Education**"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 142, "end": 209, "text": "Toby Roth was born on October 10, 1938, in Strasburg, North Dakota."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 210, "end": 294, "text": "He earned his Bachelor's degree from the University of Wisconsin–Eau Claire in 1961."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 295, "end": 315, "text": "**Political Career**"}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 317, "end": 421, "text": "Roth began his political career in 1966, serving as a member of the Wisconsin State Assembly until 1978."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 422, "end": 457, "text": "In 1978, he was elected to the U.S."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 458, "end": 536, "text": "House of Representatives, representing Wisconsin's 8th congressional district."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 537, "end": 569, "text": "**United States Representative**"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 571, "end": 658, "text": "Roth served as a United States Representative from January 3, 1979, to January 3, 1997."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 659, "end": 827, "text": "During his tenure, he was a member of the Republican Party and served on several committees, including the Committee on Ways and Means and the Committee on Agriculture."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 828, "end": 981, "text": "According to the Biographical Directory of the United States Congress, Roth's congressional service spanned from the 96th Congress to the 104th Congress."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 982, "end": 985, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 987, "end": 1001, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1003, "end": 1060, "text": "[1] Biographical Directory of the United States Congress."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1061, "end": 1068, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1069, "end": 1080, "text": "Roth, Toby."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1081, "end": 1172, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/bioguideretro.congress.gov\\/Home\\/MemberDetails?memIndex=R000474>"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1174, "end": 1207, "text": "[2] Wisconsin Historical Society."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1208, "end": 1215, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1216, "end": 1244, "text": "Toby Roth Papers, 1966-1996."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1245, "end": 1321, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.wisconsinhistory.org\\/Records\\/Article\\/CS350>"}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1323, "end": 1336, "text": "[3] GovTrack."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1337, "end": 1344, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1345, "end": 1349, "text": "Rep."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1350, "end": 1360, "text": "Toby Roth."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1361, "end": 1441, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.govtrack.us\\/congress\\/members\\/toby_roth\\/403344>"}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1443, "end": 1654, "text": "This Wikipedia entry provides comprehensive evidence for the statement \"Toby Roth holds the position of United States representative\" by presenting Roth's early life, political career, and congressional service."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["Catholic archbishop", "United States Representative"]}
